- op: discuss  # 26ff
  at: '2026-10-10T20:31:40Z'  # 26ff
  by: agent  # 26ff
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 26ff
  clock: 3  # 26ff
  nonce: 26ff  # 26ff
  message: "Fixed in PR #1518 (merged, d68a14fb84). Root cause confirmed: VENDOR_ROOT = Path(__file__).parents[4]/'vendor' exists only in a source checkout; the core wheel packages only src/hypergumbo_core. Fix: vendor tree moved to hypergumbo_core/vendor/ (package data, VENDOR_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent/'vendor'); LICENSE (MIT x3) + UPSTREAM ship alongside; compressed core wheel 2,703,208 -> 3,419,413 bytes. BEHAVIOURAL EVIDENCE. Wheels built as release.yml does (python -m build packages/<pkg> for core, lang-mainstream, lang-common, lang-extended1, hypergumbo), installed by explicit wheel path into a fresh non-editable venv (third-party deps from PyPI), run from a directory outside the repo. BEFORE (dev @ 286c579b0a; also the published PyPI hypergumbo-core 8.1.0 gives the same): 'hypergumbo build-grammars' -> for each of lean/wolfram/circom 'Error: vendored source not found at <venv>/vendor/tree-sitter-<name>/src / See docs/grammars/vendor-sync.md...', summary 3x ✗, stderr 'Failed to build: lean, wolfram, circom', exit 1. AFTER (branch head, same procedure): wheel contains 24 files under hypergumbo_core/vendor/; 'hypergumbo build-grammars' -> 'Successfully installed tree-sitter-{lean,wolfram,circom}', 3x ✓, verification prints three tree_sitter.Language capsules, exit 0; 'hypergumbo build-grammars --check' -> 3x ✓, exit 0; no files written into the installed vendor dir (24 before and after). Error path live: with the installed vendor dir renamed away, exit 1 and 'Error: grammar source not found at <site-packages>/hypergumbo_core/vendor/tree-sitter-lean/src / It ships inside the hypergumbo-core package; this install is incomplete. Reinstall it, e.g.: pip install --force-reinstall --no-deps hypergumbo-core'. Tests: test_build_grammars.py gains package-relative VENDOR_ROOT, wheel-config shape, and actionable-error tests (red before, green after). Analogue sweep of packages/*/src for parents[N] / ../.. / __file__ traversal: no other site reaches outside its package (cli.py cache_dir.parent x3 is a cache path; tracker setup.py pkg_dir.parents[1] is guarded by ValueError and only used to build a git+ URL). Note: the fix reaches PyPI users only with the next release (8.1.0 on PyPI still has the bug)."  # 26ff
